<span class="cat-badge">Guide &middot; Pricing</span>
<h1>Honda Vision Short vs Long-Term Rental Cost in Hanoi: Cost Planning Guide</h1>
<p>The Honda Vision rents in Hanoi under three verified structures: 200,000 VND per day, 1,000,000 VND per week, and a monthly band of 1,800,000 to 2,000,000 VND confirmed with the desk for your machine and dates. This guide compares short-term against long-term cost so the calendar, not habit, picks the rate, and every figure quoted here is verified; where a range exists, the guide says so and sends you to the counter rather than inventing a midpoint.</p>
<p>We line up all three figures, locate the two break-evens at five days and ten days, describe what each structure is honestly for, list the mistakes that cost money at both ends of the scale, and close with the deposit and support questions longer stays add. Start at the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental-cost/">Hanoi motorbike rental cost</a> hub, see the full model range at the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental/">Hanoi motorbike rental</a> guide, and check common questions on the <a href="/faq/">rental FAQ</a>.</p>
<nav class="toc">
<ol>
  <li><a href="#sec-1">The three verified rates</a></li>
  <li><a href="#sec-2">Short-term: the honest window</a></li>
  <li><a href="#sec-3">Long-term: the honest window</a></li>
